{"timestamp": "2026-10-07T04:06:00.043248+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "We respect the strength of a proficient in-house team; it is a critical asset. My intent is not to pitch, but to have a professional discussion on process.\n\nEven the strongest teams can face challenges with resource allocation during volatile periods. How do you currently manage analytic bandwidth to ensure deep diligence is uniformly applied during sudden deal flow spikes?\n\nOur analysis is built on a 6-Pillar DD framework that provides a structured, multi-faceted view of early-stage projects. Some funds use this as a supplemental research layer to handle overflow, freeing their core analysts to concentrate on the highest-conviction targets."}
