{"timestamp": "2026-10-07T04:08:07.340995+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "Excellent questions. They get to the core of how we deliver value without creating new bottlenecks. Our entire service is built to minimize your 'time-to-useful-output'.\n\nOur speed and quality are products of a standardized methodology: the OrbLabs 6-Pillar DD Framework. This structured process ensures every analysis, whether a standard or Fast-Track engagement, covers the same critical dimensions:\n1. Team & History\n2. Technology & Code\n3. Tokenomics & Distribution\n4. Go-to-Market & Community\n5. Governance & Legal\n6. On-Chain & Market Data\n\nThis framework is also how we guarantee minimal onboarding overhead. Instead of requiring your team to train us, you simply provide the target. We execute our self-contained process and deliver a comprehensive report.\n\nFor firms like yours, the time-to-useful-output is immediate upon delivery. The report is a synthesized analysis, not a data dump, allowing your team to instantly focus on strategic decisions rather than foundational research."}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-07T04:08:24.186116+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 817, "candidates_tokens": 196, "total_tokens": 2595, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-07T04:08:24.186615+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "Thank you for the direct questions. Our model is built to answer them.\n\nOur speed and quality stem from a standardized methodology: the OrbLabs 6-Pillar DD Framework. It ensures every analysis\u2014regardless of analyst\u2014covers Team, Tokenomics, Technology, Go-to-Market, Competitive Landscape, and Governance.\n\nThis structured approach is key to requiring minimal onboarding overhead. We don't need to be managed; we just need the target. We then execute the framework and deliver a comprehensive report within 48-72 hours.\n\nThis self-contained process eliminates the risk of us becoming another dependency. You receive a complete, structured analysis package, which significantly reduces your team's time-to-useful-output. The quality is a function of the framework's rigor, not an individual's ad-hoc process.\n\nThis entire system is designed to provide reliable, on-demand overflow capacity. The structure is validated through execution."}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-07T04:08:40.862410+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 810, "candidates_tokens": 171, "total_tokens": 2515, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-07T04:08:40.862894+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy", "proposal_text": "Excellent questions. Our entire process is designed to address them.\n\nMethodology & Onboarding: We achieve speed with minimal onboarding overhead via our proprietary OrbLabs 6-Pillar DD Framework. This standardized process allows us to take a target and your core thesis and immediately begin analysis without requiring your team's time for ramp-up. It's a self-contained system.\n\nQuality & Speed: The framework enforces rigor and consistency, which is how we ensure quality under tight deadlines. Each analysis systematically covers six core diligence areas, and the final report is reviewed against this internal standard before delivery.\n\nTrack Record: For funds like yours, this structured approach significantly reduces time-to-useful-output. You receive a predictable, actionable diligence package that integrates directly into your decision-making process, providing the overflow capacity you need during deal spikes."}
